<doc id="87804" url="https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=87804" title="Bebop">
Bebop

Bebop
Menurut beberapa sumber yang relevan, Bop adalah sebuah type dari breakdance, yang dibuat oleh Keneth Bob Mill's. Bop dansa bentuk baru, mengkombinasikan pergerakan lengan/tangan yang smooth (ex "robot") dan koordinsi yang skillfully dengan gerakan kaki.
Bebop
Kisaran: 1940-50
"Secara teknis, bebop berkarakter tempo cepat, harmoni komplex, melodi yang penuh perubahan, dan rhythm sections yang laid down a steady beat only on the bass and the drummer's ride cymbal. Bebop tunes were often labyrinthine, full of surprising twists and turns. All these factors - plus the predominance of small combos in bebop - set the music apart from the Swing bands of the 1930s."
- from David H. Rosenthal's book, Hard Bop, published by Oxford Paperbacks, New York, 1992
And coming out of bebop, with the assistance of Miles Davis, and a few other cats, came Cool, and, following closely on its heels and borrowing the suffix, Hard Bop.
Bassists
Ray Brown, Charles Mingus
Composers
